{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55185","headline":"励学吟 · 智闲","name":"励学吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满口语，无处说，明明向道人（一作「人道」）不决。\n急着力，勤咬囓，无常到来救不彻。\n口里话（一作「语」），暗嗟（一作「瑳」）切，快磨古锥净挑揭。\n理尽觉，自护持，此生事，吾（一作「终」）不说，玄旨（一作「学」）求他古老吟，禅学须穷心影绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}